{"id":"00080","root":"uni00080_1","name":{"ja":"レティシア・ベルメール","en":"Laetitia Bellmer"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"レティシア・ベルメール","en":"Laetitia Bellmer"},"element":"Science","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-03-14","limited":false,"characterId":65,"profile":{"ja":"米連の特殊技能開発により能力を発現させた少女。自分の血液を液体に浸透させる事で、疑似的に自分の身体の一部として操る事ができる能力。対魔の力の解析の副産物の研究で産まれた能力。レティシアは幼いころから米連に所属し、兵士としての訓練を受けていた。ある日、特秘任務として、米連の実験に参加し、アクア・ミストレスを発現させる。以降、魔族と対魔忍との抗争するチームに参加し、裏社会での戦闘を行う兵士となる。物事の善悪はすべて軍が決めるとして、非道な任務にも感情を殺して進めるが、時として民家や子供まで襲う事に、疑問を持ち始めている。任務に忠実であり、任務中は感情を表に出さずにこなす。普段も基本的にはクールであり、物事に熱くなるタイプでは無い。","en":"Laetitia Bellmer is a girl whose abilities were awakened through the United States' special skills development program. By permeating her own blood into a liquid, she can manipulate it as an extension of her body—a power born from research into anti-demon forces. Laetitia has been part of the U.S. forces since childhood, receiving soldier training. One day, on a classified mission, she participated in a U.S. experiment and manifested the Aqua Mistress ability. Since then, she has joined a team fighting demons and Taimanin, becoming a soldier in the underworld's battles. She believes the military decides all matters of right and wrong, suppressing her emotions even during brutal missions, though she has begun to question attacks on civilian homes and children. She is loyal to her orders and never shows emotion while on duty. Generally, she remains cool-headed and never gets overly passionate about anything."},"illustrator":"相川亜利砂","voiceActor":"和葉","forms":[{"id":"uni00080_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[976,1952],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[116,232],"def":[137,274],"spd":[84,84],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","130007"]},{"id":"uni00080_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1452,2904],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[167,334],"def":[209,418],"spd":[84,84],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5"